{{Quote|You could ride a trappu. It's a large reptile we use to pull our wagons when the landspeeders are busy.|[[Tracer Lore]]|<ref name="Mission to Disaster">''[[The High Republic: Mission to Disaster]]''</ref>}}
'''Wagons''' were vehicles used on the<ref name="Mission to Disaster" /> [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="A Test of Courage">''[[The High Republic: A Test of Courage]]''</ref> [[planet]] [[Dalna]] by the [[Dalnan]]s. They were pulled by [[trappu]]s, large [[reptile]]s [[Homeworld|native]] to the planet.<ref name="Mission to Disaster" />

{{Veh-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[2020]] novel ''[[Ronin: A Visions Novel]]'', wagons were used on the Outer Rim planet [[Genbara]]. Wagons, [[landspeeder]]s, and pedestrians traveled to Genbara's [[Osou spaceport]] to sell [[Farm|crops]]. One such wagon one traveled to the [[spaceport]] carried multiple children and was pulled by a massive [[scaled boar]].<ref name="Ronin">''[[Ronin: A Visions Novel]]''</ref>

